<div class="xsto-container py-8 md:py-12 "><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Why choose the XSTO M4?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The M4 is XSTO's popular smart electric chair featuring self-balancing technology for stability, foldable design for compact storage, adjustable seat height (347–650 mm), 10° slope capability, omnidirectional mecanum wheels enabling 360° rotation, app-based remote control, and detachable 4-module quick disassembly ideal for travel."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can the M4 be used on grass, sand, or gravel?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes! Its robust tyres and powerful motor handle grass, packed sand, and gravel effectively. For loose sand or rough ground, reduce speed to maintain stability."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the M4's maximum weight capacity?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The M4 supports up to 115 kg (254 lbs) and maintains stable performance within this limit for safe operation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does the M4 battery last on a single charge?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Under typical daily use (regular speed, moderate terrain), the standard 25.55V 15.5Ah battery provides up to 15 km (9.3 miles) per charge. Full recharge takes approximately 4 hours."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can the M4 be taken on flights?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The M4 includes a standard 25.55V 15.5Ah removable battery. For air travel, a compatible lower-capacity airline battery (sold separately) is recommended. While that battery meets most airline requirements, please confirm with your airline before flying."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How soon can I receive the M4 after ordering?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Within the UK: 3–4 working days with free delivery to mainland addresses. For Scottish Highlands, Northern Ireland, and offshore islands, please contact us for delivery timescales. A tracking number will be emailed after dispatch."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What warranty is included with the M4?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The M4 is covered by the standard XSTO manufacturer warranty: 5 years on the frame and base seat structure, 1 year on electrical and mechanical parts (motors, controller, etc.), and 1 year on the battery."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I claim VAT relief on the M4?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. If you have a long-term illness or disability, you can purchase the M4 VAT-free. Simply complete a VAT exemption declaration during checkout."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why choose the XSTO M4B?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The M4B builds on the award-winning M4 platform with an improved integrated folding footrest for easier transfers and new front suspension for a smoother ride. It keeps self-balancing control, electric height adjustment (347–650 mm), 10° slope capability, and app-based remote control."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does the M4B differ from the M4?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The M4B adds a new front-wheel design and integrated folding pedals. Weight without battery is 55.5 kg (vs 51.5 kg on the M4). Core performance — 115 kg capacity, 15 km range, 6 km/h top speed, and 10° max slope — matches the M4."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the M4B's maximum weight capacity?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The M4B supports up to 115 kg (254 lbs) and maintains stable performance within this limit for safe operation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does the M4B battery last on a single charge?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Under typical daily use (regular speed, moderate terrain), the standard 25.55V 15.5Ah battery provides up to 15 km (9.3 miles) per charge. Full recharge takes approximately 4 hours."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can the M4B be taken on flights?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The M4B includes a standard 25.55V 15.5Ah removable battery. For air travel, a compatible lower-capacity airline battery (sold separately) is recommended. While that battery meets most airline requirements, please confirm with your airline before flying."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How soon can I receive the M4B after ordering?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Within the UK: 3–4 working days with free delivery to mainland addresses. For Scottish Highlands, Northern Ireland, and offshore islands, please contact us for delivery timescales. A tracking number will be emailed after dispatch."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What warranty is included with the M4B?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The M4B is covered by the standard XSTO manufacturer warranty: 5 years on the frame and base seat structure, 1 year on electrical and mechanical parts (motors, controller, etc.), and 1 year on the battery."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I claim VAT relief on the M4B?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. If you have a long-term illness or disability, you can purchase the M4B VAT-free. Simply complete a VAT exemption declaration during checkout."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What makes the M4 Pro different from the standard M4?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The M4 Pro is the premium edition featuring a 150 kg weight capacity (vs 115 kg), 26 km range (vs 15 km), 0–20° electric seat tilt, 135° backrest recline, integrated LED turn signals and brake lights, 85 mm obstacle clearance, and a 450–730 mm adjustable seat height for standing-desk compatibility."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can the M4 Pro handle slopes and uneven terrain?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The M4 Pro handles slopes up to 15° safely thanks to its self-balancing gyroscopic system. It also manages grass, packed sand, gravel, and uneven pavements. The 85 mm obstacle clearance lets it roll over door thresholds and small kerbs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does the M4 Pro battery last?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The M4 Pro provides up to 26 km (16 miles) per charge under normal use. A full recharge takes approximately 6 hours. The battery is removable for easy replacement or charging off the chair."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the M4 Pro foldable for transport?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The M4 Pro features one-button electric folding and can be disassembled into modules for car transport. The heaviest single part weighs approximately 28 kg, making it manageable for most people to lift into a vehicle boot."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How soon can I receive the M4 Pro after ordering?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Within the UK: 3–4 working days with free delivery to mainland addresses. For Scottish Highlands, Northern Ireland, and offshore islands, please contact us for delivery timescales. A tracking number will be emailed after dispatch."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What warranty comes with the M4 Pro?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The M4 Pro is covered by the standard XSTO manufacturer warranty: 5 years on the frame and base seat structure, 1 year on electrical and mechanical parts (motors, controller, etc.), and 1 year on the battery. Free UK mainland delivery is included, and our customer support team is available on 020 8050 4849."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I claim VAT relief on the M4 Pro?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. If you have a long-term illness or disability, you can purchase the M4 Pro VAT-free. Simply complete a VAT exemption declaration during checkout."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does the M4 Pro have LED lights?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The M4 Pro features an integrated LED safety system with turn signals, brake lights, and ambient lighting for enhanced visibility when driving in low-light conditions or on roads."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I make a warranty claim?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Contact our UK support team at sales@bentechmeduk.com or call 020 8050 4849 with your order number and a short description (photo or video where possible). As the official UK distributor, Bentech Medical Ltd manages all warranty claims directly with the manufacturer on your behalf — no need to ship anything overseas."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can the X12 really climb stairs?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The X12 uses caterpillar track technology to safely climb and descend stairs at angles up to 40°. The AI-powered system automatically adjusts speed and balance on each step, and a companion can monitor progress via the app."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does the X12 handle different terrains?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The X12 is a true all-terrain machine. Beyond stairs, it handles grass, gravel, sand, mud, snow, and steep hills. The dual-track system provides exceptional traction and stability on surfaces that would stop a conventional chair."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the X12's battery range?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The X12 comes with dual 25.2V 25.6Ah batteries providing up to 35 km (22 miles) of range on a single charge. Both batteries charge simultaneously, and the system can operate on a single battery if needed."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does the X12 weigh?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The X12 weighs 112.8 kg without battery (about 115.8 kg as X12 Pro with the electric elevating leg rest). It is not designed to be lifted like the M4 series — it is built for all-terrain performance and stair-climbing capability. It can be transported in a suitable vehicle with a ramp or hoist."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the X12 available to buy now?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The X12 is in stock now, with an estimated delivery of 10 days. Free UK mainland delivery is included."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What's included in the box with the X12?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The X12 comes with the robot, 2× batteries, charger, joystick controller, wireless key, user manual, and tool kit. The X12 is app-controlled, so no physical remote control is included."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the difference between X12 and X12 Pro?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"They are the same X12 chair. X12 Pro adds an electric elevating leg rest; the standard X12 does not. Both share the same 136 kg capacity, 40° stair capability, dual batteries, and 35 km range. Choose X12 or X12 Pro when you add the chair to your cart, then add any accessories."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How soon will my order arrive?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"In-stock M4, M4B and M4 Pro: free UK mainland delivery in 3–4 working days. X12 typically arrives in 10 days. X12 accessories are on a ~4 week pre-order — you can still buy them today. Other in-stock models typically arrive in 5–7 working days."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you deliver to Scottish Highlands and Northern Ireland?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We deliver across the UK and Ireland. Scottish Highlands, Northern Ireland and offshore islands may have extended lead times — contact us on 020 8050 4849 for a delivery estimate before ordering."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book a demonstration before I buy?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Visit an authorised stockist or book a demo with Bentech Medical Ltd via our demo request form. Many stockists offer in-store demonstrations."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What warranty is included?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"All XSTO wheelchairs include a 5-year frame warranty, 1-year electrical and mechanical parts warranty, and 1-year battery warranty. Bentech Medical Ltd manages all UK warranty claims as the official distributor."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I register my warranty?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Complete the warranty registration form on our Warranty page with your name, email, order reference, serial number and purchase date. Registration helps us process claims faster."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who handles warranty claims in the UK?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Bentech Medical Ltd, as the official UK distributor, manages all warranty claims directly with the manufacturer. Contact sales@bentechmeduk.com or call 020 8050 4849."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I claim VAT relief on XSTO products?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. If you have a long-term illness or disability, you may purchase eligible mobility aids VAT-free under HMRC rules. Complete a VAT exemption declaration during checkout to claim relief."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What declaration do I need to provide?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"During checkout, confirm you have a qualifying long-term illness or disability and provide your name, address and nature of condition. This HMRC declaration is stored with your order."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can a charity or care home claim VAT relief?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"VAT relief on mobility aids generally applies to eligible individuals. Charities and businesses should contact us for guidance on their specific circumstances."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer trade pricing?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Healthcare professionals, care providers and mobility retailers can request a trade quote via our quote request form. A team member will respond within one business day."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I become an authorised stockist?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Bentech Medical Ltd appoints authorised UK and Ireland stockists. Email sales@bentechmeduk.com with your company details and territory to discuss partnership."}}]}</script><header class="mb-8 max-w-3xl"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://mobilityrobot.co.uk"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"FAQ"}]}</script><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><a href="/" class="hover:text-gold">Home</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page" class="font-medium text-foreground">FAQ</span></li></ol></nav><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-foreground md:text-4xl">Frequently Asked Questions</h1><p class="mt-3 text-lg text-muted-foreground">Everything you need to know about XSTO products, ordering, warranty, VAT relief and trade accounts.</p></header><div class="space-y-10"><section aria-labelledby="faq-product"><h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-foreground" id="faq-product">Product</h2><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-xl border border-border"><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Why choose the XSTO M4?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4 is XSTO&#x27;s popular smart electric chair featuring self-balancing technology for stability, foldable design for compact storage, adjustable seat height (347–650 mm), 10° slope capability, omnidirectional mecanum wheels enabling 360° rotation, app-based remote control, and detachable 4-module quick disassembly ideal for travel.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can the M4 be used on grass, sand, or gravel?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes! Its robust tyres and powerful motor handle grass, packed sand, and gravel effectively. For loose sand or rough ground, reduce speed to maintain stability.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What is the M4&#x27;s maximum weight capacity?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4 supports up to 115 kg (254 lbs) and maintains stable performance within this limit for safe operation.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How long does the M4 battery last on a single charge?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Under typical daily use (regular speed, moderate terrain), the standard 25.55V 15.5Ah battery provides up to 15 km (9.3 miles) per charge. Full recharge takes approximately 4 hours.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can the M4 be taken on flights?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4 includes a standard 25.55V 15.5Ah removable battery. For air travel, a compatible lower-capacity airline battery (sold separately) is recommended. While that battery meets most airline requirements, please confirm with your airline before flying.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How soon can I receive the M4 after ordering?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Within the UK: 3–4 working days with free delivery to mainland addresses. For Scottish Highlands, Northern Ireland, and offshore islands, please contact us for delivery timescales. A tracking number will be emailed after dispatch.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What warranty is included with the M4?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4 is covered by the standard XSTO manufacturer warranty: 5 years on the frame and base seat structure, 1 year on electrical and mechanical parts (motors, controller, etc.), and 1 year on the battery.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can I claim VAT relief on the M4?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. If you have a long-term illness or disability, you can purchase the M4 VAT-free. Simply complete a VAT exemption declaration during checkout.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Why choose the XSTO M4B?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4B builds on the award-winning M4 platform with an improved integrated folding footrest for easier transfers and new front suspension for a smoother ride. It keeps self-balancing control, electric height adjustment (347–650 mm), 10° slope capability, and app-based remote control.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How does the M4B differ from the M4?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4B adds a new front-wheel design and integrated folding pedals. Weight without battery is 55.5 kg (vs 51.5 kg on the M4). Core performance — 115 kg capacity, 15 km range, 6 km/h top speed, and 10° max slope — matches the M4.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What is the M4B&#x27;s maximum weight capacity?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4B supports up to 115 kg (254 lbs) and maintains stable performance within this limit for safe operation.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How long does the M4B battery last on a single charge?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Under typical daily use (regular speed, moderate terrain), the standard 25.55V 15.5Ah battery provides up to 15 km (9.3 miles) per charge. Full recharge takes approximately 4 hours.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can the M4B be taken on flights?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4B includes a standard 25.55V 15.5Ah removable battery. For air travel, a compatible lower-capacity airline battery (sold separately) is recommended. While that battery meets most airline requirements, please confirm with your airline before flying.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How soon can I receive the M4B after ordering?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Within the UK: 3–4 working days with free delivery to mainland addresses. For Scottish Highlands, Northern Ireland, and offshore islands, please contact us for delivery timescales. A tracking number will be emailed after dispatch.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What warranty is included with the M4B?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4B is covered by the standard XSTO manufacturer warranty: 5 years on the frame and base seat structure, 1 year on electrical and mechanical parts (motors, controller, etc.), and 1 year on the battery.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can I claim VAT relief on the M4B?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. If you have a long-term illness or disability, you can purchase the M4B VAT-free. Simply complete a VAT exemption declaration during checkout.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What makes the M4 Pro different from the standard M4?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4 Pro is the premium edition featuring a 150 kg weight capacity (vs 115 kg), 26 km range (vs 15 km), 0–20° electric seat tilt, 135° backrest recline, integrated LED turn signals and brake lights, 85 mm obstacle clearance, and a 450–730 mm adjustable seat height for standing-desk compatibility.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can the M4 Pro handle slopes and uneven terrain?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. The M4 Pro handles slopes up to 15° safely thanks to its self-balancing gyroscopic system. It also manages grass, packed sand, gravel, and uneven pavements. The 85 mm obstacle clearance lets it roll over door thresholds and small kerbs.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How long does the M4 Pro battery last?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4 Pro provides up to 26 km (16 miles) per charge under normal use. A full recharge takes approximately 6 hours. The battery is removable for easy replacement or charging off the chair.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Is the M4 Pro foldable for transport?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. The M4 Pro features one-button electric folding and can be disassembled into modules for car transport. The heaviest single part weighs approximately 28 kg, making it manageable for most people to lift into a vehicle boot.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How soon can I receive the M4 Pro after ordering?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Within the UK: 3–4 working days with free delivery to mainland addresses. For Scottish Highlands, Northern Ireland, and offshore islands, please contact us for delivery timescales. A tracking number will be emailed after dispatch.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What warranty comes with the M4 Pro?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4 Pro is covered by the standard XSTO manufacturer warranty: 5 years on the frame and base seat structure, 1 year on electrical and mechanical parts (motors, controller, etc.), and 1 year on the battery. Free UK mainland delivery is included, and our customer support team is available on 020 8050 4849.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can I claim VAT relief on the M4 Pro?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. If you have a long-term illness or disability, you can purchase the M4 Pro VAT-free. Simply complete a VAT exemption declaration during checkout.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Does the M4 Pro have LED lights?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. The M4 Pro features an integrated LED safety system with turn signals, brake lights, and ambient lighting for enhanced visibility when driving in low-light conditions or on roads.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How do I make a warranty claim?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Contact our UK support team at sales@bentechmeduk.com or call 020 8050 4849 with your order number and a short description (photo or video where possible). As the official UK distributor, Bentech Medical Ltd manages all warranty claims directly with the manufacturer on your behalf — no need to ship anything overseas.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can the X12 really climb stairs?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. The X12 uses caterpillar track technology to safely climb and descend stairs at angles up to 40°. The AI-powered system automatically adjusts speed and balance on each step, and a companion can monitor progress via the app.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How does the X12 handle different terrains?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The X12 is a true all-terrain machine. Beyond stairs, it handles grass, gravel, sand, mud, snow, and steep hills. The dual-track system provides exceptional traction and stability on surfaces that would stop a conventional chair.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What is the X12&#x27;s battery range?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The X12 comes with dual 25.2V 25.6Ah batteries providing up to 35 km (22 miles) of range on a single charge. Both batteries charge simultaneously, and the system can operate on a single battery if needed.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How much does the X12 weigh?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The X12 weighs 112.8 kg without battery (about 115.8 kg as X12 Pro with the electric elevating leg rest). It is not designed to be lifted like the M4 series — it is built for all-terrain performance and stair-climbing capability. It can be transported in a suitable vehicle with a ramp or hoist.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Is the X12 available to buy now?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. The X12 is in stock now, with an estimated delivery of 10 days. Free UK mainland delivery is included.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What&#x27;s included in the box with the X12?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The X12 comes with the robot, 2× batteries, charger, joystick controller, wireless key, user manual, and tool kit. The X12 is app-controlled, so no physical remote control is included.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What is the difference between X12 and X12 Pro?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">They are the same X12 chair. X12 Pro adds an electric elevating leg rest; the standard X12 does not. Both share the same 136 kg capacity, 40° stair capability, dual batteries, and 35 km range. Choose X12 or X12 Pro when you add the chair to your cart, then add any accessories.</p></details></div></section><section aria-labelledby="faq-ordering-delivery"><h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-foreground" id="faq-ordering-delivery">Ordering &amp; Delivery</h2><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-xl border border-border"><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How soon will my order arrive?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">In-stock M4, M4B and M4 Pro: free UK mainland delivery in 3–4 working days. X12 typically arrives in 10 days. X12 accessories are on a ~4 week pre-order — you can still buy them today. Other in-stock models typically arrive in 5–7 working days.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Do you deliver to Scottish Highlands and Northern Ireland?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. We deliver across the UK and Ireland. Scottish Highlands, Northern Ireland and offshore islands may have extended lead times — contact us on 020 8050 4849 for a delivery estimate before ordering.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can I book a demonstration before I buy?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. Visit an authorised stockist or book a demo with Bentech Medical Ltd via our demo request form. Many stockists offer in-store demonstrations.</p></details></div></section><section aria-labelledby="faq-warranty"><h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-foreground" id="faq-warranty">Warranty</h2><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-xl border border-border"><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What warranty is included?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">All XSTO wheelchairs include a 5-year frame warranty, 1-year electrical and mechanical parts warranty, and 1-year battery warranty. Bentech Medical Ltd manages all UK warranty claims as the official distributor.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How do I register my warranty?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Complete the warranty registration form on our Warranty page with your name, email, order reference, serial number and purchase date. Registration helps us process claims faster.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Who handles warranty claims in the UK?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Bentech Medical Ltd, as the official UK distributor, manages all warranty claims directly with the manufacturer. Contact sales@bentechmeduk.com or call 020 8050 4849.</p></details></div></section><section aria-labelledby="faq-vat-relief"><h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-foreground" id="faq-vat-relief">VAT Relief</h2><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-xl border border-border"><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can I claim VAT relief on XSTO products?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. If you have a long-term illness or disability, you may purchase eligible mobility aids VAT-free under HMRC rules. Complete a VAT exemption declaration during checkout to claim relief.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What declaration do I need to provide?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">During checkout, confirm you have a qualifying long-term illness or disability and provide your name, address and nature of condition. This HMRC declaration is stored with your order.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can a charity or care home claim VAT relief?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">VAT relief on mobility aids generally applies to eligible individuals. Charities and businesses should contact us for guidance on their specific circumstances.</p></details></div></section><section aria-labelledby="faq-trade"><h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-foreground" id="faq-trade">Trade</h2><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-xl border border-border"><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Do you offer trade pricing?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. Healthcare professionals, care providers and mobility retailers can request a trade quote via our quote request form. A team member will respond within one business day.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can I become an authorised stockist?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Bentech Medical Ltd appoints authorised UK and Ireland stockists. Email sales@bentechmeduk.com with your company details and territory to discuss partnership.</p></details></div></section></div></div>
